## Keep tag

`--keep-tag TAG` keeps every snapshot that carries the tag, whatever its age. It has no count and no period, and on its own it keeps nothing else, not even the newest snapshot. When that would leave a series with no snapshot, forget removes nothing at all and exits 1, naming the series. The history is a week of daily backups, some of them tagged `release`.
